      "writtenOn": "2026-09-15T22:27:33Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The fan table ramp-up logic in this test seems to conflict with the \u0027temp-on\u0027 thresholds defined in quartz.overlay. \n\nFor level 1, temp-on is 44, but the test expects it to trigger at 43. \nFor level 5, temp-on is 52, but the test expects it to trigger at 51. \n\nIs the underlying fan control logic using a \u0027greater than\u0027 comparison instead of \u0027greater than or equal\u0027, or is there a 1-degree offset intended here?",
